:: University_Hall_Basement
    <<nobr>>
        <<passagehead locations university_hall_basement>>
            <<speech plr thought>>
                Only a little creepy, it least it doesn't look like an actual dungeon.
            <</speech>>
        <</passagehead>>
    <</nobr>>
    <<nobr>>
        <div class='passage-links-grid-2'>
            <<TimeCheck '1100' '1300' weekdays>>
                <<button [[Room B-3 | Basement_Class_RoomB3]]>>
                    <<calcTime 0 5>>
                <</button>>
            <</TimeCheck>>
            <<TimeCheck '1100' '1300' cycleNoWeekend>>
                <<button [[Room B-3 (locked) | Basement_Class_RoomB3_Closed]]>>
                    <<calcTime 0 5>>
                <</button>>
            <</TimeCheck>>

            <<button [[Entry Hall | University_Entrance]]>>
                <<calcTime 0 5>>
            <</button>>
        </div>
    <</nobr>>